numgothic   \" id=\"SE-ff27ff22-85fc-438d-ac1e-5d2457d50720\">게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a75e74b7-1daa-4275-a743-33057799f7a7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f8e53567-ec35-4974-bf43-9556a39b1879\">업데이트 리소스를 다운로드해 주시기 바랍니다.​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d4fc5a3d-e6e1-4be9-a587-ed75c8adf457\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-fbe5eae8-73d4-4364-9295-ecbf9d35dc99\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0d459ca9-549f-47cd-b59c-ce08d6a357be\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d59cd1bb-0374-44dc-897b-cb6ea9f33a80\">​​자세한 설명은 아래를 확인해 주시기 바랍니다.​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f23475e0-3342-4e3e-a6c6-436807cd5c6e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-14bb9293-6d0d-48c4-9f5f-5b768e7c7753\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7a99ba0d-e6bf-4ba9-9023-d0946514d37b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-45911b64-6ff0-4aac-9c21-f69862769b47\">​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c1ed40b0-72fb-45ef-b10d-7fca622c134c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-fe166f2c-9b18-4880-838e-6bc5cf90afe5\"><b>📢 4월 4일(금) 무점검 업데이트 안내​​​​​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2dc8668a-e212-48f1-a0f3-507b7aa4063f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5b2b6e4c-6fb3-455f-8338-ba280cc30f81\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2f2909f6-8ed8-4aca-85fb-70184d92fc4f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-87ae3d71-65d4-4858-ab34-d33bced32d83\"><b>​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-358aeca6-1e6e-47bd-8c60-11e2bbb5475d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-75ac643a-f164-4636-abde-d4d90a37e9ba\">- 4/4(금) 20:00 경​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-91e8fa1c-5eac-4841-bf65-788188e52b61\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6c4fd8c4-2abc-491d-8fe5-7f4adeb3c010\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a14b4310-ea45-4c5b-bb78-d4a2c94860f2\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d8637364-768b-4486-b6a0-1b89a206be9a\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-373302e4-3043-48e9-98e1-4d5bc0316859\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-1b5c6798-c367-4090-b630-77358551ac17\">1. 분배 대미지 관련 무점검 업데이트 이후 검은 뱀 분신의 일부 공격이 의도와 다르게 동작하는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64adc240-15fd-4bf8-99ac-3cdd5ddce0b4\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-885098a9-082f-4c07-bf4a-df335fd3a0e5\">2. 검은 뱀의 공격 패턴과 일치하도록 검은 뱀의 스킬 설명을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dffaa295-a3cf-4859-a640-091acc7a161d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a7952f33-bb9d-4d18-a654-1257674a9a83\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-607da7a6-7f68-4e65-83ea-72c8a3e2ec59\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-dd8016a9-5329-4a7e-863d-a27b27c07a68\">​​​※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8abfa7f5-cbb2-4dd2-9b89-00cbc04fba31\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3e78913a-f0ff-43ed-a87a-ba15f10b71cf\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1335c92b-6932-4f9a-a376-8a94be9af6af\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-75672283-f809-470e-af1b-168966cc3011\">·····················································································​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-62054440-9e3d-4c0e-973b-a30cfe7a137f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2639552f-4c33-4a10-b497-efe6c6bf2e49\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-88b5f2ff-0ae2-45cc-9dd8-e78db2a840c2\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b3fa108d-2d5d-41d6-83dd-a2eff1d074be\">게임 이용에 불편을 끼쳐 드려 죄송합니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                         